# sriq ABox split (slice 9j): an individual that must not be folded. a has at most one r-successor,
# and it is B; a r b, and b : ¬B. Folding a and b apart would lose a r b and the clash.
# Expect: inconsistent.
@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .

:B a owl:Class . :r a owl:ObjectProperty .
:a a owl:NamedIndividual , [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :r ; owl:maxCardinality 1 ] ,
       [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :r ; owl:someValuesFrom :B ] ;
   :r :b .
:b a owl:NamedIndividual , [ owl:complementOf :B ] .
